WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.217
Category labels often look different even when they mean the same thing.

00:00:07.217 --> 00:00:14.297
Web, space-web-space, EMAIL, email, and Store contain differences in capitalization and whitespace.

00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:22.239
Str dot strip removes extra spaces, and str dot lower converts everything to lowercase.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:29.034
After standardization, web values group together and email values group together correctly.

00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:33.372
This kind of cleanup is essential before counting or grouping categories.
